Error [E0205]: Cannot edit `n` — `c` does not have the write-access marker `&`
  --> body_write_to_unmarked_param_is_error.jet:6:7
    |
  6 |     c.n = c.n + 1
    |       ^
 Why: Editing a field requires the write-access marker `&` on the owning place
 Fix: Mark the parameter with the write-access marker `&`: `c: &Counter` to grant write access
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
